<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Email Verification - RFM Facility Management</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin: 20px auto;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #003366;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .content {
            color: #333333;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 16px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #003366;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 15px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #ffcc00;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" align="center">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <table class="container" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="header">
                            Water & Electricity Facility Management
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="content">
                            <p>Dear <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
                            <p>Welcome to Electricity & Water Facility Management! We're excited to have you on board.</p>
                            <p>To complete your registration, we just need you to verify your email address. Please click the button below to confirm your email:</p>
                            <div class="button-container">
                                <a href="<%= url %>" class="button">Verify Your Email</a>
                            </div>
                            <p>This verification link is valid for the next <strong>24 hours</strong>. If you did not request this, please ignore this message—your account will remain secure.</p>
                            <p>If you need any assistance, feel free to reach out to our support team at <a href="mailto:support@gov.com.au">support@gov.com.au</a>.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="footer">
                            <p>Best regards,</p>
                            <p><strong>Electricity & Water Facility Management Team</strong></p>
                            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@gov.com.au">support@gov.com.au</a></p>
                            <p>Website: <a href="https://www.gov.com.au/">www.gov.com.au</a></p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>